==Round of 16==

===Switzerland vs Germany===
[[file:Germany v Switzerland WC 1938 (2).jpg|thumb|230px|Germany v Switzerland]]
Switzerland adopted a precursor version of the ''[[Catenaccio]]'' system to try stopping the talented German forwards. Thanks to this tactical system, the Swiss managed to frustrate the Germans despite going behind after a goal from [[Josef Gauchel|Gauchel]]. Switzerland drew level with [[André Abegglen|Abegglen]] after a mistake from [[Willibald Schmaus]]. Although the Germans pushed for the win, the game ended with a draw, forcing a replay.<ref name="fiedler" >{{Cite book |title=The Complete History of the World Cup |last=Fielder |first=Robert |publisher=Kindle Edition |year=2018}}</ref>

