===Hungary vs Dutch East Indies===
[[File:La Hongrie face aux Indes néerlandaises à Reims, 1938.jpg|thumb|230px|Hungary vs Dutch East Indies]]
The difference in strength between the two teams was evident as the game resulted in a humiliation for the Dutch East Indies, which managed to hold out for just 13 minutes. In the second half, although Hungary relaxed their pressure, they were never truly troubled by the opponents.<ref name="fiedler" />

