===Cuba vs Romania===
[[file:Romania v Cuba WC 1938 (1).jpg|thumb|230px|Cuba v Romania, first match]]
Cuba, who had only qualified because other Latin American selections had withdrawn, impressed against Romania. Romania scored first through either [[Silviu Bindea]] or [[Nicolae Kovács]], depending on the source. Cuba drew level through [[Héctor Socorro]], who converted a cross from [[José Magriñá]] and then took the lead with a goal from Magriñá himself. However, equalisers from [[Iuliu Baratky]] and [[Ștefan Dobay]] forced a replay.<ref name="fiedler" />

