===France vs Belgium===
The hosts took the lead with only 35 seconds on the clock thanks to a shot from close range by winger [[Émile Veinante]]. France doubled their advantage soon after, but the lead was halved before the interval thanks to [[Hendrik Isemborghs]], who connected with a free kick from [[Bernard Voorhoof]]. In the second half, [[Jean Nicolas]] got his brace, sealing the victory for France.<ref name="fiedler" />

