===Italy vs Norway===
Mindful of the game played against Norway at the semi-finals of the [[Football at the 1936 Summer Olympics|1936 Summer Olympics]], when Italy managed to scrap a win only during extra time, [[Vittorio Pozzo]] was not to be overconfident. Italy managed to grab an early lead with [[Pietro Ferraris]], but struggle to threaten Norway's goal further besides hitting the post once. In the second half, Norway was the better team, hitting the woodwork thrice and finally drawing level in the 83rd minute. Soon inside the extra time, [[Silvio Piola]] converted in goal a rebounded shot. Italy managed to hold out for the remaining time, reaching the quarter-finals.<ref name="fiedler" />

