==Match for third place==
Sweden started on the front foot, taking a double lead inside 38 minutes. In the first half, Brazil looked uninspired until they got one back before half-time. In the second half, Brazil was reinvigorated and pushed for the comeback. In the second half, [[Leônidas (footballer, born 1913)|Leônidas]] scored twice, while [[Patesko]] missed a penalty. [[José Perácio]] secured the victory in the 80th minute.<ref name="fiedler" />

